Z||000011||stimpy||11-19-2001||10:16 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Freshj:<BR><B>Hey stimpy, I don't suppose you have the Dimensions..........</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P> <IMG SRC="http://pip.pennock.nl/uploads/sub_003_copy.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://pip.pennock.nl/uploads/sub_002_copy.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://pip.pennock.nl/uploads/sub_001_copy.jpg">  <BR>As you can see, the shape is pretty freeform, and I way suck at math trying to figure out the volume of the enclosure. But the box is designed for .5 cu ft to .35 cu ft box. and it booms even with a cheaper amp. My understanding is that if you want tighter bass, you go with a smaller box, which would be easily done by filling with expanding foam. <p>[This message has been edited by stimpy (edited 11-19-2001).]||||reg||1
