Z||000013||Silver88GT||11-20-2001||01:12 PM||||Here is the option I went with: <A HREF="http://www3.sympatico.ca/meckanic/subwoof.html." TARGET=_blank>http://www3.sympatico.ca/meckanic/subwoof.html.</A>   It fits an 8" where the factory sub went under the dash on the passenger side...totally out of sight and out of the way.<P>The bass is not thundering, but a better sub and more powerful amp than what I currently have would probably help. All I was looking for was a fuller sound than 4x10s can provide and this delivered.||||reg||1
